    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5776c1411055ea43c75a9efa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了！\n太厉害了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69642e69310a40ab1dfae0f538b8c7b485b252c081df1d0a928beb01efcc165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aa97057484a8371d8a6b678",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我时刻都会选择最合适的着装。\n在商务场合，外表给人的\n真诚感会直接关系到信任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21b9c767c6cfa830f166f77c4f1aea310f3a3a9c1ad8a9302edc2f1e63f50760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7982de86b47286ea8c042e7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外套当然是在父亲的公司\n定制的。设计和\n面料全都是由我亲自构思的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4219da4e18d5da3a3d45c6779c57d9a97b0122751ac7d6964bd2348cff498d56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:891f14e07c59af38fa309fc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受母亲和姐姐的影响，穿上高跟鞋\n曾是我的梦想呢♪我想现在我\n已经能完美驾驭它了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53658f40797d12142dccdd05cdd4db99586c59d471457d90550ea9b7871a3ae4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e70d4eb92ba0ee42ec19d7a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不愧是你……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8def1032c58d90b127d488c9a14ca778dee317bc2d3fc9dc8891b3a84bc3564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f039d4afd8f52d9e0c6cc0d0",
