    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91db9e67b33b662ae8b34bb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……能稍等我一下吗？\n没关系，只要有时间的话……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08d58248b68ec4477d07d1726504078477dcf57aa7c3dff522cf035a0cad665e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a95c0be4932fecacf129dbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这点小事不算什么。\n至今为止我不也是设法挺过来了吗……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b47001d5938eecd68f6aa153710a673b3b2e10b0e6634d810f5c99d5230a5b0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:615339708cf7d087d1779b28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……，正因为是现在，\n一定有只有现在才能做到的事……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29569eb7da64636c10ab94668b1bb34e2b45a260bb4a95247eee6496fffbd048",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15cf25d8eef36f7b39d01cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该从哪件事开始着手呢……\n那个——",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cb590c9b2898c0311bfc35125a01fc29ab0116f2965fae80d34ace294674dab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24513ea8017d9d8d124061e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得这不是个好选择。\n要不要重新制定一下\n今后的计划？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf9ce3f54771f87798d493584b2bf2def988e7d0d130827f4bb09ada2ae9ac04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a10ed75af3b1d46ee159d2fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……挑战与鲁莽是两回事。\n胡乱前进可不是上策。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52d27af53659d420f7aefde1b7b422ab02d169dbce1aea0c4e6f8565291bc840",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19b941efece2f75f722253d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以毫无不安地告诉你——！\nI'm confident!",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbbc43e1ce28c6ac2bd4283079cda450c7854409689753956ad5488e19b26616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c077ae7bc993909cad291a72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功前的这种高昂感……！\n呵呵，一定会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7edf8cba75012fa74d9eb3cd345db6746c40dc0da085853e21c69e2a4dda3a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a0ab6a9522bc6e0192b8292",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Perfect!\n这可是无可挑剔的完成度哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0125add4a9c8fb12adf68edabfa3df006d278a3a2d415957e34c0c2842cc6be3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afd619c85363c0ae8a56e8d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体能万全！\n心态极佳！\n已经没有什么好担心的了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af074bec21849e1c943a70308287d1344224db24aea2d41e564ab918fe5e7d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4031455d65b72a8a8c6c4cca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以说实话吗？\n——现在，我超级有自信！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1445d1492c3042dc775813b6b19c08ba763d903df0cb3698caa927041b74fd2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52cd11fbd26e97a73dec2a57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的表情也很棒呢♪\n能以那种状态守护着我的话，\n真的很令人安心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b280d4dfe8c3b2b698b025c2bd3c63091ac3d9d79958068db737aa307b808c98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:779da481a1c783c36356b20b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会堂堂正正地去战斗的。\n无论对手是谁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e682c8948ac8b09e07eb5195c537aabd01a69ca1efad48c43338c501f72bcea6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:166454615fef60700f491d48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的支持，\n我绝不会让它白费的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ee2afe49fe206575ca82e00953d44c0c2238abf09a1ce7ab05ea7fb7149bdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f32f6479451cb958ac799986",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也会尽力而为。\n如果有主意的话，\n你也要随时告诉我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "315548ee968a10481dc5b21eaccfe9c1ccd0d083b2ec2701a7a81b548d186b3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f0dcfc5891e7d977d7c8f1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系……\n挑战这种事我已经习惯了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a7f024f96a7fa5f102c565ba8b5deabb21e24d11f46daac6a17f9ebd6e4d8f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:311371a91359651e692abea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "化危机为转机，\n应该是我的拿手好戏才对……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dffff6afcaeb538fa2990d4b6879248fba15f9edcc1815c348615c4c8165d17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350ed83f69e94307321537bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我没有不安。\n是的，没有……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a05454ad720d98eb0a732ba00964cbc907ba284c607b67aa6b376a053dbcdf44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b9a62f3b6f73d254b8b6d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……克服困难这种事，\n我应该已经习惯了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bfcbc54b79700d03572b10dc610edee3dcf1967f77e4f6a3efc673ce4b35ff6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c3903d4e20c7634f07467ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么双腿，\n会如此沉重……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "423eb0ab12671180c9470e2fbe5e454d62772e35d7487ebe48fd8e06a54ff191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4649c729276729fffea86504",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无问题……\n绝对，绝对要……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f151feed681742c32833e8ae71d55002ff22d035fe3b93450ec04855bc3b1432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9f0bb3b8b7a04375722dfe1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8480f70f25069ad1ba3438b074aabfaa36e877df868aec010ba70e384152088",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dfdb4c1e6f28082f95d9a2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f6f9cb6d386b03a59eafb944e976a93775f81d43c59dffa89b8cc34793a942f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5259650f69aaf2101bc60780",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "259094e5a27d8b74ef6c993df596f92eace76ba061f4116e7799ac4847d895f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da3f49316f6bce21af5e869b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f6f9cb6d386b03a59eafb944e976a93775f81d43c59dffa89b8cc34793a942f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e766803eeffdc1aef7bd9138",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdba625e48012ccb9ad71877721cc10414ee827e304b5a1a6b72f395d5735f23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d34463dd701a46a90295eaeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed046546d61c8ed6ca5dc48cfde01c6ebc8c0c1ff70fc6023f97a3fb46e99390",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a51471e10ab3a0d41180981",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f6b9bd84d15fdda6d271e71fead524f963f37facd4f12bdc521fa576af3f2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ad4cc59ac312b7777a9dd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不错呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a11803102be6a33859f532c32997a9e2c166850c857cc68d35f67105b65f70f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5895b149492c66255ed15f4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多谢！真是获得了宝贵的经验！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b62af1e5b7d6ab3c65dccc1c5bd9d41c0c95ea5aaeb96921550b48c536e10190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4f3bd2a54afc8f59e738693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你一直陪我走下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c649459b2f5deb4156afcdcdfca871a53e06f58516aeedb834db5cf84b19a50a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
